{
  "id": "1SA.28",
  "number": "28",
  "bookId": "1SA",
  "reference": "1 Samuel 28",
  "copyright": "The Holy Bible, New International Version® NIV® Copyright © 1973, 1978, 1984, 2011 by Biblica, Inc.® Used by Permission of Biblica, Inc.® All rights reserved worldwide.",
  "verseCount": 25,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "28",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 28"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "28",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In those days the Philistines gathered their forces to fight against Israel. Achish said to David, \"You must understand that you and your men will accompany me in the army.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "David said, \"Then you will see for yourself what your servant can do.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "1SA 28:2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Achish replied, \"Very well, I will make you my bodyguard for life.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Saul and the Medium at Endor",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now Samuel was dead, and all Israel had mourned for him and buried him in his own town of Ramah. Saul had expelled the mediums and spiritists from the land.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Philistines assembled and came and set up camp at Shunem, while Saul gathered all Israel and set up camp at Gilboa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When Saul saw the Philistine army, he was afraid; terror filled his heart.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He inquired of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.28.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.28.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", but the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.28.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.28.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "did not answer him by dreams or Urim or prophets.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saul then said to his attendants, \"Find me a woman who is a medium, so I may go and inquire of her.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "1SA 28:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"There is one in Endor,\" they said.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So Saul disguised himself, putting on other clothes, and at night he and two men went to the woman. \"Consult a spirit for me,\" he said, \"and bring up for me the one I name.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But the woman said to him, \"Surely you know what Saul has done. He has cut off the mediums and spiritists from the land. Why have you set a trap for my life to bring about my death?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saul swore to her by the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.28.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.28.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", \"As surely as the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.28.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.28.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lives, you will not be punished for this.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the woman asked, \"Whom shall I bring up for you?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "1SA 28:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Bring up Samuel,\" he said.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When the woman saw Samuel, she cried out at the top of her voice and said to Saul, \"Why have you deceived me? You are Saul!\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The king said to her, \"Don't be afraid. What do you see?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "1SA 28:13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "The woman said, \"I see a ghostly figure",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "coming up out of the earth.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"What does he look like?\" he asked.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "1SA 28:14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"An old man wearing a robe is coming up,\" she said.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "1SA 28:14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Then Saul knew it was Samuel, and he bowed down and prostrated himself with his face to the ground.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samuel said to Saul, \"Why have you disturbed me by bringing me up?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "1SA 28:15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"I am in great distress,\" Saul said. \"The Philistines are fighting against me, and God has departed from me. He no longer answers me, either by prophets or by dreams. So I have called on you to tell me what to do.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samuel said, \"Why do you consult me, now that the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.28.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.28.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "has departed from you and become your enemy?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.28.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.28.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "has done what he predicted through me. The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.28.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.28.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "has torn the kingdom out of your hands and given it to one of your neighbors—to David.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Because you did not obey the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.28.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.28.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "or carry out his fierce wrath against the Amalekites, the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.28.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.28.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "has done this to you today.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.28.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.28.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "will deliver both Israel and you into the hands of the Philistines, and tomorrow you and your sons will be with me. The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.28.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.28.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "will also give the army of Israel into the hands of the Philistines.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Immediately Saul fell full length on the ground, filled with fear because of Samuel's words. His strength was gone, for he had eaten nothing all that day and all that night.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When the woman came to Saul and saw that he was greatly shaken, she said, \"Look, your servant has obeyed you. I took my life in my hands and did what you told me to do.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now please listen to your servant and let me give you some food so you may eat and have the strength to go on your way.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He refused and said, \"I will not eat.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "1SA 28:23"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "But his men joined the woman in urging him, and he listened to them. He got up from the ground and sat on the couch.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The woman had a fattened calf at the house, which she butchered at once. She took some flour, kneaded it and baked bread without yeast.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then she set it before Saul and his men, and they ate. That same night they got up and left.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
